<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: engraved tolga -->
  <BA_EngravedTolga.label>雕刻托尔加头巾头盔</BA_EngravedTolga.label>
  <!-- EN: The turban helmet or Tolga in Turkish, is a historical variety of combat helmet with a bulbous shape and fluting that imitates the folds of a turban. Turban helmets originated in Ottoman Turkey, primarily used by warriors and some non-Turkish auxiliaries.\n\n<i><color=#66E0E4FF>Medieval Kingdoms: The Turks</color></i> -->
  <BA_EngravedTolga.description>托尔加头巾头盔（土耳其语称托尔加）是一种具有历史意义的战斗头盔，呈圆顶造型，带有模仿头巾褶皱样式的凹槽纹路。这种头巾头盔起源于奥斯曼土耳其，主要为战士及部分非突厥裔辅助部队所使用。</BA_EngravedTolga.description>
  
</LanguageData>